000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.     TDSCINQM.
000400 AUTHOR.         DAVID A. PLUM, JR.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.   MAY 1985.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.   THE GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER COMPANY - AKRON.
000800*REMARKS.
000900**************************************************************
001000*                                                            *
001100*D  T D S C I N Q M     DESCRIPTION INQUIRY MAIN PROGRAM     *
001200*D                                                           *
001300*   SUBPROGRAMS CALLED:                                      *
001400*                                                            *
001500*     1) SDSCINQ - INQUIRY SUBPROGRAM                        *
001600*     2) TBLOWUP - BLOWUP SUBPROGRAM                         *
001700*                                                            *
001800*D  THIS PROGRAM SERVES AS A FRONTEND PROGRAM FOR THE        *
001900*D  SUBPROGRAM "SDSCINQ".  AS A FRONTEND PROGRAM ITS ONLY    *
002000*D  FUNCTIONS ARE THE FOLLOWING:                             *
002100*D    1) OPEN THE TERMINAL, FORMSFILE, DATA BASE, AND THE    *
002200*D       MESSAGE FILE.                                       *
002300*D    2) OBTAIN THE MPLTINFO-PARMS TO BE PASSED TO SDSCINQ.  *
002400*D    3) CALL "SDSCINQ" USING BASE,                          *
002500*D                            VIEW-COMAREA,                  *
002600*D                            LANGUAGE-PARMS,                *
002700*D                            MPLTINFO-PARMS                 *
002800*D    4) CLOSE THE TERMINAL, FORMSFILE, DATA BASE, AND THE   *
002900*D       MESSAGE FILE.                                       *
003000*                                                            *
003100**************************************************************
003200*   09/19/85  ADDED CALLS TO FINDJCW, NLAPPEND, CATOPEN, AND *
003300*             CATCLOSE IN ORDER TO ACCOMODATE THE NATIVE     *
003400*             LANGUAGE SUPPORT FACILITY.  ADDED LINKAGES AND *
003500*             ALSO MADE THE CHANGE TO THE FORMFILE NAMES.    *
003600*                                     PD RAGLOW              *
003700*                                                            *
003800*   03/26/86  ADDED DATA BASE CALLS TO OBTAIN THE PLANT CODE *
003900*             AND THE LANGUAGES (FOR DDESC AND DDESC2) FROM  *
004000*             MPLTINFO.  THESE PARAMETERS ARE NEEDED BY THE  *
004100*             CALLED SUBPROGRAMS.                            *
004200*                                  D.A. PLUM                 *
004300*                                                            *
004400*   11/21/86  CHANGED REFERENCES TO FORMFILE FDSCINQ TO      *
004500*             FCSISINQ.  FDSCINQ IS BEING ELIMINATED.        *
004600*                                  D.A. PLUM                 *
004700**************************************************************
004800
004900 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
005000 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
005100 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
005200 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MPLTINFO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

005300
005400 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  MPLTINFO-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500  OF MCFLCS0501.

005500 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
005600
005700*************************************************************
005800*************************************************************
005900**                                                         **
006000**              D A T A    B A S E    A R E A              **
006100**                                                         **
006200*************************************************************
006300*************************************************************
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".
006400
006500 01  BASE                       PIC X(10)  VALUE "  STORES;".
006600 01  PASSWORD                   PIC X(5)   VALUE "JADE;".
006700 01  DSET-NAME                  PIC X(16)  VALUE SPACES.
006800
006900 COPY DBMODES IN COPYCSIS.
007000
007100 COPY DBSTAT IN COPYCSIS.
007200
007300 01  SEARCH-ITEMS.
007400     05  ALL-ITEMS              PIC X(2)  VALUE "@;".
007500
007600 01  ARG-VALUES.
007700     05  PLT-ARG                PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
007800
007900 01  DSET-NAMES.
008000     05  DSET-MPLTINFO          PIC X(16) VALUE "MPLTINFO;".
008100
008200 COPY MPLT0 IN COPYCSIS.
008300 COPY MPLTP01 IN COPYCSIS.
008400 COPY MPLTPLAN IN COPYCSIS.
008500
008600 COPY VCOMAREA IN COPYCSIS.
008700
008800 01  MESSAGE-BUFLEN             PIC S9(4)  COMP VALUE 76.
008900 01  MESSAGE-ACTLEN             PIC S9(4)  COMP VALUE 76.
009000
009100 01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
009200     05  MSG-TEXT               PIC X(64)  VALUE SPACES.
009300     05  MSG-FLD                PIC X(12)  VALUE SPACES.
009400     05  MSG-FLD-9 REDEFINES MSG-FLD
009500                                PIC Z(11)9.
009600
009700 01  FORMFILE.
009800     05  FORM-FNAME                PIC X(8)  VALUE "FCSISINQ".
009900     05  FILLER                    PIC X     VALUE ".".
010000     05  FORM-GNAME.
010100         10  FORM-GNAME1           PIC X(5)  VALUE "FLANG".
010200         10  FORM-GNAME2           PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
010300     05  FILLER                    PIC X(19) VALUE SPACES.
010400
010500*************************************************************
010600*************************************************************
010700**                                                         **
010800**                  COMMUNICATIONS AREA                    **
010900**                                                         **
011000*************************************************************
011100*************************************************************
011200
011300 01  MPLTINFO-PARMS.
011400     05  MPLTINFO-PLANT-CODE       PIC X(3) VALUE SPACES.
011500     05  MPLTINFO-DDESC-LANG       PIC X(3) VALUE SPACES.
011600     05  MPLTINFO-DDESC2-LANG      PIC X(3) VALUE SPACES.
011700
011800 COPY LANGUAGE IN COPYCSIS.
011900
012000 COPY TBLOWUP IN COPYCSIS.
012100
012200*************************************************************
012300**#########################################################**
012400*************************************************************
012500**                                                         **
012600**          P R O C E D U R E    D I V I S I O N           **
012700**                                                         **
012800*************************************************************
012900**#########################################################**
013000*************************************************************
013100
013200 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
013300
013400 MAIN-PGM SECTION.
013500
013600 BEGIN-HERE.
           OPEN INPUT MPLTINFO-I.
013700     PERFORM 1-HSK.
013800     CALL "SDSCINQ" USING BASE,
013900                          VIEW-COMAREA,
014000                          LANGUAGE-PARMS,
014100                          MPLTINFO-PARMS.
           CLOSE MPLTINFO-I.
014300     GOBACK.
014400
014500 1-HSK.
014600     MOVE "TDSCINQM" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           MOVE "ZCSISINQ" TO VIEW-CFNAME.
018500
018600     MOVE "P 01" TO PLT-ARG.
018700
018800*    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-MPLTINFO, MODE7,
018900*        STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-MPLTINFO, PLT-ARG.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
020300     IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
019100         MOVE "GET MPLTINFO COMPANY ERROR IN 1-HSK"
019200             TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
019300         MOVE "MPLTINFO-KEY= "     TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
019400         MOVE "P 01"               TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
019500         PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.
019600
019700     MOVE MPLTINFO-COMPANY TO MPLTINFO-PLANT-CODE.
019800
019900     MOVE "PLAN" TO PLT-ARG.
020000
020100*    CALL "DBGET" USING BASE, DSET-MPLTINFO, MODE7,
020200*        STATUS-AREA, ALL-ITEMS, BUF-MPLTINFO, PLT-ARG.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
020300     IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
020400         MOVE "GET MPLTINFO LANGUAGES ERROR IN 1-HSK"
020500             TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
020600         MOVE "MPLTINFO-KEY= "     TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
020700         MOVE "PLAN"               TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
020800         PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.
020900
021000     MOVE PRIMARY-LANGUAGE   TO MPLTINFO-DDESC-LANG.
021100     MOVE SECONDARY-LANGUAGE TO MPLTINFO-DDESC2-LANG.
021200
023300******************************************************
023400**                  BLOWUP ROUTINE                  **
023500******************************************************
023600
023700 2-BLOWUP.
023800     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
023900           VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
024000           BU-DISPLAY-AREA.
